/Title (I decided on this photo because it communicates the positive effects of clean water in a way that seems genuine and relatable. Emma, the student activist, is my target audience, and this approach works best for her because she is driven to make a difference and witness real results. The visual enhances her emotionally to connect and reminds that her actions can result in major changes.)
